1	// Our own flat 2D cartoon cast (riflemen, officer, townsfolk, kid, parent) + 2D effects, drawn on a canvas.
2	// Construction v2 (characters.md, our own cast): superellipse heads (pointed crown 1.75 / full jaw 2.3, chin taper,
